♫Muzik dimainkan♫

10:24.780 --> 10:26.670
♫Jangan lupa♫

10:27.770 --> 10:30.190
♫Kepantasan masa berlalu♫

10:30.990 --> 10:34.860
♫Salji yang lembut menutupi gunung♫

10:34.960 --> 10:35.920
♫Balik♫

10:36.800 --> 10:38.440
