17:40.870 --> 17:43.270
di belakang Jabatan Penangkapan Syaitan.

17:44.720 --> 17:46.340
Tapi di depan saya,

17:47.110 --> 17:49.540
hanya cahaya gelombang seluas tiga kaki.

17:50.290 --> 17:52.750
